WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.723
Your dbt project, as a diagram, in about a minute.

2
00:00:03.773 --> 00:00:06.260
No AI, and nothing to configure.

3
00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:10.630
Install ERD Studio, and open your dbt project.

4
00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.994
The Get started guide opens by itself.

5
00:00:13.444 --> 00:00:17.184
Click Draw from dbt, and pick a folder, like your marts.

6
00:00:19.244 --> 00:00:24.162
It reads your models and their relationship tests, and lays out the diagram for you.

7
00:00:25.244 --> 00:00:26.957
That's your Logical design.

8
00:00:27.007 --> 00:00:29.435
Click a table to see its columns and keys.

9
00:00:29.485 --> 00:00:33.211
It's saved as plain files in your repo, next to your SQL.

10
00:00:33.661 --> 00:00:36.968
Switch to Physical to see what dbt actually built.

11
00:00:37.018 --> 00:00:40.424
Diff compares the two, and flags anywhere they disagree.

12
00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.726
Want grain, keys and the why behind each table?

13
00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:49.193
Click Set Up My AI Helper, then type /erd-studio-setup in your assistant.

14
00:00:50.174 --> 00:00:53.673
No dbt project? Try the sample project.

15
00:00:55.074 --> 00:01:00.120
ERD Studio is free. Install it, and draw your dbt project today.
